WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.600
It's Emil's turn

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.720
It's my turn...

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.940
You gave it a small kick!

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.860
I don't feel like a table anymore

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:52.900
Okay, now I'm back

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:53.900
Moving table!

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.180
I won!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.800
Okay now let's put a net onto the racket

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:08.120
Yea, this is how I originally thought that the challenge was meant to be

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.200
Net serve

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.520
Table is there!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.180
Table is there!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.780
The table is not over there, though!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.220
How did I missed it?

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.040
Where is it?

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.120
It's still in play!

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:06.780
You were in the way!

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.640
Comment who do you think won that match

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.120
The rules are a bit unclear!

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:12.960
It's up to you to decide

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.280
But yea, guys go get yourself one of these!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.480
Yea, it's very useful if you want to use a racket as a table!

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.480
Getting...

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.280
A bit tired...

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:27.680
Maybe...

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:29.220
A few more shots...

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:30.800
Then I've had it...

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.200
That's it

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:33.880
Good night

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.660
Table tennis balls?

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:52.640
Back to sleep...

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.700
I got a feeling this is going to be a lot harder for me than the opponent

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.700
Normal rubber (red) and long pimples (black)

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:09.980
Interesting

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.500
I just gotta trust it!

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:20.820
No!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.820
I think that suits Emil better than me

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.000
Definitely!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:43.940
It broke

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:44.560
What?

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:45.480
Just kidding

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.200
 Well that was wrong!

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.260
I mean... not bad!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.340
Look at that!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.840
You hit it with the pimples!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.080
Under the table!

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.700
It's just really difficult

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.840
But this is in a way interesting to try out

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:31.000
Because it shows where you actually hit the shots

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.800
Wrong rubber!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:36.800
It would have been on!

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.220
It's about 50-50 which one you hit with

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.120
Yea... about!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.680
No! He got it on!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.800
What?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.800
I gave you a spot

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.600
No but it was harder than I thought

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.460
But...

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:08.860
The biggest issue for me was that the rubber was too good

